(
    title: "Porky\'s",
    developer: Some("B. Winston Hendrickson, Randall Hyde, Mark V. Rhoads, John Simonds"),
    description: Some("Pee Wee\'s revenge, in three linked scenes. The county line is a run across bands of traffic, bouncers and attack pigs to reach Porky\'s bar and blow it up. Escaping the swamp means pole-vaulting across it and placing four bricks as a ladder. In the shower room you shove objects into a pit, and each one stops a band back on the highway."),
